        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Milwaukee Bucks, Charlotte Bobcats, Golden State Warriors, National Basketball Association\n- People: Mike James, Mo Williams, Zaza Pachulia\n- Events: 2004–05 Milwaukee Bucks season, 2004–05 NBA season, Bucks offseason\n- Topics: player transactions, professional basketball\n\nFacts:\n- The 2004–05 NBA season was the Milwaukee Bucks' 37th season in the National Basketball Association.\n- During the offseason before the 2004–05 season, the Milwaukee Bucks signed free agents Mike James and second-year guard Mo Williams.\n- During the same offseason, the Milwaukee Bucks acquired Zaza Pachulia from the expansion Charlotte Bobcats.\n- Zaza Pachulia was born on February 10, 1984.\n- Zaza Pachulia is a Georgian professional basketball player for the Golden State Warriors of the National Basketball Association.",
